	"Description": "Detects Slack Connect invitations and connections that link a channel or DM to an external organization. Each one creates a data path out of the workspace to a party you do not control. The two connect_dm actions act on a direct message rather than a channel, so the channel columns are empty for those rows - the entity type column distinguishes them.",
